<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-SATURDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SATURDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on show courts</p>
<p>at the French Open tennis championships on Saturday.</p>
<p>(matches start 0900 GMT)</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>16-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) v Dick Norman (Belgium)</p>
<p>3-Monica Seles (U.S.) v Nathalie Tauziat (France)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) v Arnaud Boetsch (France)</p>
<p>Court A</p>
<p>Dominique Van Roost (Belgium) v 6-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain)</p>
<p>Stephane Simian (France) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) v 10-Mary Pierce (France)</p>
<p>6-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) v Patrick Rafter</p>
<p>(Australia)</p>
<p>Court 1</p>
<p>12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) v Flora Perfetti (Italy)</p>
<p>14-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) v Natasha Zvereva</p>
<p>(Belarus)</p>
<p>Mark Woodforde (Australia) v 11-Albert Costa (Spain)</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) v Magnus Larsson (Sweden)</p>
</text>
